<title>SINGAPORE: Prima 1996 net profit rises 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Prima 1996 net profit rises 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.80  vs    12.30</p>
<p>    Final dividend (percent)	  15.00  vs    15.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   36.80  vs    32.80</p>
<p>    Turnover			     130.34  vs   123.37</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	9.23  vs    11.99</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     4.17  vs     5.47</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   8.79  vs     9.86</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax		    6.24  vs     5.60</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	   12.99  vs    11.70</p>
<p>    Tax					8.11  vs     4.91</p>
<p>    Minorities			     2.68  vs    (0.09)</p>
<p>Note - Prima Ltd said export sales of wheat flour and by-products continued to decline in 1996 but a slight increase in domestic sales helped its grain milling and other related business to maintain a positive performance.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
